OL,3,Vupppppp5CTuesday
OL,5,G1700 Inside the Tower of London
OL,6,     FThe Queen's Platinum Jubilee kicks
OL,7,     Foff with the Tower's longest gun
OL,8,     Fsalute in centuries. And as the
OL,9,     Fconstable prepares to retire, he
OL,10,     Ftakes part in the lighting of the
OL,11,     FJubilee beacon.
OL,12,G1800 Inside the Tower of London
OL,13,     FAs the death of Queen Elizabeth II
OL,14,     Fis announced, the Tower enters a
OL,15,     Ftwo-week official period of
OL,16,     Fmourning. And plans are made for a
OL,17,     Fbig retirement event for the
OL,18,     Fdeparting constable.
