OL,5,G1900 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,6,     FIn Tuscany, Ben meets British
OL,7,     Fcouple George and Sophie who have
OL,8,     Fbreathed new life into a
OL,9,     Ffarmhouse. George's desire to live
OL,10,     Fself-sufficiently lead to a
OL,11,     Flifelong project.
OL,12,G2000 Ben Fogle: New Lives in the Wild
OL,13,     FBen spends time with 'Pirate' Rob,
OL,14,     Fwho lives for half the year with
OL,15,     Fhis 18-year-old son Damien in a
OL,16,     Fsandbag house on an island in the
OL,17,     Fmiddle of an industrial river in
OL,18,     FOregon.
