OL,5,G2300 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,6,     FBea tells the women not to rely on
OL,7,     FNoeline for any favours, and Meg
OL,8,     Finvites Gail to her flat-warming
OL,9,     Fparty, only for Gail's husband to
OL,10,     Fmake a scene about Gail's
OL,11,     Fparenting.
OL,12,G0000 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,13,     FJudy tells Noeline that Margo is
OL,14,     Fon to them, Meg worries about Gail
OL,15,     Fand her family, and Vera notices
OL,16,     Fthat Lizzie hasn't run out of
OL,17,     Fcigarettes.
